menu "ZigBeetle Configuration"

config USE_104NT4
    bool "Use 104NT-4 thermistor instead of AHT21B"
    default y
    help
        When enabled, the firmware uses a 104NT-4 thermistor on ADC GPIO4
        and disables the current AHT21B (ASAIR) LP-core I2C path.

config DEBUG
    bool "Enable diagnostic info logs"
    default n
    help
        Enables optional informational diagnostics such as LP sensor counters
        and raw HP probe bytes. Disable to reduce serial log noise.

endmenu
